WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.424 --> 00:00:03.213
Unit six. Community Life!

2
00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:10.549
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level three!

3
00:00:10.599 --> 00:00:14.042
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.092 --> 00:00:17.605
Today we learn: Community Life. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.705 --> 00:00:22.572
Civic duty. Say it with me. Civic duty!

6
00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:29.509
Volunteer. Say it with me. Volunteer!

7
00:00:33.026 --> 00:00:36.576
Neighborly. Say it with me. Neighborly!

8
00:00:40.074 --> 00:00:44.657
Local initiative. Say it with me. Local initiative!

9
00:00:48.124 --> 00:00:51.424
Charity. Say it with me. Charity!

10
00:00:54.949 --> 00:00:58.315
Donate. Say it with me. Donate!

11
00:01:01.814 --> 00:01:05.480
Collaborate. Say it with me. Collaborate!

12
00:01:08.996 --> 00:01:12.996
Grassroots. Say it with me. Grassroots!

13
00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.333
Outreach. Say it with me. Outreach!

14
00:01:23.832 --> 00:01:27.882
Support system. Say it with me. Support system!

15
00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:35.567
Solidarity. Say it with me. Solidarity!

16
00:01:39.058 --> 00:01:42.658
Contribute. Say it with me. Contribute!

17
00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:56.861
Grammar time! can or could for ability & suggestion. Listen. Students can volunteer. We could organize a charity event.

18
00:01:56.911 --> 00:02:03.431
Your turn. Say it with me. Students can volunteer. We could organize a charity event.

19
00:02:08.623 --> 00:02:17.433
Volunteering for a local initiative taught me about civic duty. Our community shows solidarity through charity and neighborly support.

20
00:02:17.483 --> 00:02:18.994
I like this story!

21
00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:25.504
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:25.554 --> 00:02:26.704
Neighborly!

23
00:02:27.437 --> 00:02:32.634
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:32.684 --> 00:02:33.834
Collaborate!

25
00:02:34.797 --> 00:02:42.575
Think and answer. How can students contribute to their community?

26
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:43.775
Great answer!

27
00:02:44.935 --> 00:02:49.874
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:49.924 --> 00:02:51.765
Bye-bye, friends!

